    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a charming and challenging adventure in &quot;Purfect Climb&quot;! In this vertical platformer, you control an agile cat who must climb floating platforms to reach new heights. With a cute theme and relaxing music, each game becomes a unique journey, where each fall makes you start from where you fell, with no checkpoints. How high can you get?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Purfect Climb&quot; combines charming visual elements with a progressive difficulty that will test your skills and patience. Perfect for players who love challenges and roguelike games (but you don't die).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Explore charming scenarios and overcome unpredictable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Enjoy a relaxing soundtrack that makes each attempt a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Beat your own records and share your achievements!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a charming and challenging adventure in &quot;Purfect Climb&quot;! In this vertical platformer, you control an agile cat who must climb floating platforms to reach new heights. With a cute theme and relaxing music, each game becomes a unique journey, where each fall makes you start from where you fell, with no checkpoints. How high can you get?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Purfect Climb&quot; combines charming visual elements with a progressive difficulty that will test your skills and patience. Perfect for players who love challenges and roguelike games (but you don't die).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Explore charming scenarios and overcome unpredictable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Enjoy a relaxing soundtrack that makes each attempt a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Beat your own records and share your achievements!</p>",
    "short_description": "Climb to the top in this challenging vertical platformer combining precision, skill and strategy. Face unique obstacles, overcome each drop and conquer the goal in a single breath. Can you reach the top?",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian",
